The fixer caught two real bugs in my test, and the second one is almost too on-the-nose:

```ts
// mine — a hardcoded literal producing the unprefixed name
const name = '__Secure-better-auth.session_token'.replace('__Secure-', '');
// fixed — read off the wire
const name = live.name;
```

I hardcoded the cookie name **in the very test whose gotcha entry says never hardcode the cookie name**. It also caught that I split the signed value on the *first* dot where better-call uses `lastIndexOf('.')`.

